# Ash Enterprise: 13 - Remote APIs as Resources

```elixir
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_resource_inclusion?, false)
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_config_inclusion?, false)

Mix.install([{:ash, "~> 3.0"}, {:req, "~> 0.5"}], consolidate_protocols: false)
```

## A REST API is a resource

